==English==

===Etymology===
A [[neologism]] that was originally coined and used by the prop-makers from [[w:Industrial Light & Magic|Industrial Light & Magic]] while working on production of the original [[w:Star Wars (film)|''Star Wars'']] film. {{rfe|en}} 

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈɡɹiːbliː/}}
* {{audio|en|En-us-greeble.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{hyphenation|en|gree|ble}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A small piece of [[detailing]] added to break up the [[surface]] of an [[object]] and add [[visual]] interest, particularly in [[movie]] [[special effect]]s.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|nurnie}}

